TSM pxrender.dll -- PrimeXT's renderer for the reTS client, built from source
==============================================================================

What this is
------------

ts\cl_dlls\pxrender.dll is PrimeXT's client renderer (github.com/SNMetamorph/PrimeXT), adapted to
The Specialists and H9 in reTS\cl_dll\primext\. client.dll loads it only when r_primext is 1 at
start, and hands it the engine's render interface; with r_primext 0 it is never loaded and
ref_gl.dll draws as before. Windows 32-bit only: other builds of the client have no
HUD_GetRenderInterface and draw with ref_gl.

It needs the files under ts\: glsl\ (the shaders, compiled into ts\cache\glsl\ on first use),
gfx\*.dds, gfx\decals\decalinfo.txt with the puddle pictures, gfx\grass\grassinfo.txt,
gfx\particles\effects.txt, scripts\default_ts.mat, scripts\materials.def and sprites
ull.spr.

Where each file came from and under which licence: reTS\PRIMEXT-SOURCES.md and
reTS\PRIMEXT-LICENCES.md. The cvars: CVARS.md, "The PrimeXT renderer".

