Rollback
--------

Delete pxrender.dll, or set r_primext 0: client.dll then never loads it.

The PrimeXT features (2026-11-25)
---------------------------------

Built from the reTS sources of this commit. CMake, Visual Studio 2026, Win32, Release, target
pxrender. What changes (shaders in ts\glsl of the same commit; the DLL and the shaders go together):

- Water: a planar mirror with Fresnel, fine ripples from gfx\water\water_normal_0..31.tga, the
  texture only a tint, cubemap reflection, refraction, func_water on PrimeXT's path; under water a
  fog; the mirror clip plane also on AMD.
- Physically based shading (r_lighting_brdf 1) no longer turns the world black; metal brushes are
  lit by dynamic lights (their metalness halved).
- One shadow map per light a frame.
- env_postfx_controller (PostFxSettings, with a fade from what is on screen), func_monitor (a
  live camera on a screen texture) and func_portal; the look is reset at each map.

